<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="wrap narrow section prose">
  <h1>Terms of use &amp; privacy</h1>
  <p class="muted small">Plain-language summary. Please have these reviewed by a Ghanaian lawyer before launch.</p>

  <h2>1. What we are</h2>
  <p><%= siteName %> is a listing platform that connects landlords and tenants directly. We are not an agent, we are not a party to any tenancy agreement, and we do not collect rent.</p>

  <h2>2. Landlords</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You may only list property you own or have the owner's written authority to let.</li>
    <li>Listings must be accurate and use real photos of the actual property.</li>
    <li>You must not charge tenants agent, commission, viewing or “form” fees through any listing on this platform.</li>
    <li>You are responsible for complying with the Rent Act, 1963 (Act 220) and other applicable laws.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Tenants</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Use the platform honestly and treat landlords with respect.</li>
    <li>Do your own checks before paying — see our <a href="/safety">safety guide</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Moderation</h2>
  <p>We may review, edit, hide or remove listings and suspend accounts that break these rules or that we reasonably believe are fraudulent.</p>

  <h2>5. Liability</h2>
  <p>We take reasonable steps (identity checks, moderation and reports) to keep the platform safe, but we cannot guarantee any listing, landlord or tenant. Any agreement is between landlord and tenant.</p>

  <h2>6. Privacy (Data Protection Act, 2012 (Act 843))</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>What we collect:</strong> your name, email, phone number, listings, messages and — for landlords who choose to verify — your Ghana Card number and image.</li>
    <li><strong>Why:</strong> to run the service, to let landlords and tenants contact each other, and to prevent fraud.</li>
    <li><strong>Who sees it:</strong> your phone number is shown only to logged-in users when they are viewing your active listing or chatting with you. Ghana Card data is visible only to our verification staff and is never published.</li>
    <li><strong>Your rights:</strong> you can ask to see, correct or delete your data at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a>.</li>
    <li>We do not sell your data.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
